me_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15067, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019Jncge739UhhWY9pK4KHLh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15863, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NmanZjNtPHKFy3cHoLNwZY", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 16163, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NmanZjNtPHKFy3cHoLNwZY", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16163, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NmanZjNtPHKFy3cHoLNwZY", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18794, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012HMuKRaSpWj8kgJknL3JGk", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Deployment history shows v2.3.1 as unhealthy in production; v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (partial failure, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed across us-east, us-west, and eu-west. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002, all regions on v2.3.0. v2.3.1 has not been redeployed. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49394, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012HMuKRaSpWj8kgJknL3JGk", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49394, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012HMuKRaSpWj8kgJknL3JGk", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 51306, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AM1hAp46jqa3Mmp7GEjzDW", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51606, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AM1hAp46jqa3Mmp7GEjzDW", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51606, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AM1hAp46jqa3Mmp7GEjzDW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54040, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 was unhealthy. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, and it completed in all regions. No deploy was needed, so change-manager approval was not required.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident **INC-0001** is open for checkout-api. The create request timed out, but the incident was recorded, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 has not been redeployed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XfYJbyF5Bu649WZHztRU7r", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PtsxXkUzRcuzh6PQkzEgvb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UrMJoPpgfHAh78yohURofv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RtbcVS6vZNE6apNdH1d5HE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KsbwYZuRZRW17KZ3kPWwRL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on the unhealthy v2.3.1. The rollback is still in scope, so I'll retry it once to finish the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019Jncge739UhhWY9pK4KHLh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NmanZjNtPHKFy3cHoLNwZY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy. Next I'll open the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012HMuKRaSpWj8kgJknL3JGk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Deployment history shows v2.3.1 as unhealthy in production; v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (partial failure, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed across us-east, us-west, and eu-west. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002, all regions on v2.3.0. v2.3.1 has not been redeployed. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out, so it may or may not have been created. I'll check the incident list before retrying to avoid a duplicate page.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AM1hAp46jqa3Mmp7GEjzDW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 was unhealthy. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, and it completed in all regions. No deploy was needed, so change-manager approval was not required.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident **INC-0001** is open for checkout-api. The create request timed out, but the incident was recorded, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 has not been redeployed.", "type": "text"}]}]}